# What stays out of git, grouped by why (CommonShared docs/11-gitignore.md; reviewed 2026-11-16).
# Not ignored on purpose: ui/ (the committed UI build: people run StreamHub without Node) and the
# kit's vendor files, including templates/ui-kit/vendor/pyodide/python_stdlib.zip (so no *.zip rule).

# Regenerable: dependencies and build output (npm ci; npm run build; tools\build-release.ps1)
ui-src/node_modules/
/dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Machine-local: written on each machine by the installer and updater
version.txt
config/*.local.json
/.streamhub/

# Captured third-party material (policy): what the probe and the capture tools record from
# Copilot's page and traffic is reference-only, read-only, and never committed. It can hold tenant
# names, ids and reply text. A recorded fixture goes into tests/fixtures only after scrubbing
# (AGENTS.md "Repository"). tests/Repository.Tests.ps1 fails if one of these is tracked.
probe-report.txt
probe - Copy.txt
capture-report.json
StreamHub-agent-capture-*/

# Secret or personal: never committed (the project has no .env; this keeps one out if it appears)
.env
.env.*

# Machine-local tooling: absolute paths, local indexes, generated agent files
# - .repowise/: the local code index and its owner key
# - .claude/: every file there is machine-local (settings.json holds absolute hook paths into
#   CommonShared, rules/commonshared-*.md are managed copies its sync rewrites, CLAUDE.md is
#   generated by repowise); the project's instructions are AGENTS.md and the root CLAUDE.md
# - .vscode/, .mcp.json: editor and MCP settings written by repowise (absolute repo paths)
# - .github/copilot-instructions.md: generated by repowise; AGENTS.md carries the same notes
.repowise/
.claude/
.vscode/
.mcp.json
.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Agent lessons kept on this machine (AGENTS.md "Shared practices"; pulled upstream by CommonShared)
tasks/lessons.md

# Scratch and parallel work: never part of a commit
/temp/
/.worktrees/
*.log

# OS noise (OneDrive and Explorer write these)
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
